{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/220552-a-fetch-s-mien","id":220552,"title":"A Fetch's Mien?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-08-06T16:18:24-07:00","id":220552,"title":"A Fetch's Mien?","content":"Fetches don't <i>have</i> them, right? They look totally human all the time? Then how does it seem that I've come across multiple places in the game where it seems to suggest changelings mistaking fetches for other changelings. They may look the same humans, but unless the changeling hardly changed worth a damn from their durance, I don't see how changelings could fall for it.<br /> <br /> Or am I missing something about how changelings see each other?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3655-elliegray","name":"elliegray","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-06T16:57:23-07:00","id":220581,"title":"","content":"Yep. Mostly.<br /> <br /> They do have an Echo that allows them to fake having a Mien, though; False Seeming, I believe. And of course, a fetch looks a lot like his or her counterpart's Mask, so they could be pretending to be their counterpart after fortifying the Mask.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","